1
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:07,730
It's me. I know you can 't stand to see me.
喂 是我 我知道你不想跟我共處一室

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,500
I'm trying to apologize over the phone
我想用電話跟你道歉…

5
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,980
I shouldn't have kissed your girlfriend
我不該親你的女朋友…

6
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:27,010
Stop calling!
別再打來了

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:31,350
This is 92.3 WXRK,K-Rock...
這裡是92.3搖滾廣播電台

8
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:34,080
...calling with our $ 1000 daily challenge!
您是今天的千元挑戰者

9
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,560
All right!
漂亮

10
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:36,890
What is the name of...
請問...

11
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:41,330
...your roommate who is very sorry and would do anything?
你那位非常抱歉 願意盡全力…

12
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,380
-Damn it,Chandler,stop calling. -Joey,it's Ross.
錢德，別再打來了 喬伊，我是羅斯

14
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,700
-Sorry. -It's all right.
對不起 沒關係

15
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:52,940
What's up?
什麼事？ 

16
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:59,040
Not much. I got Chandler here and he's really,really sorry
也沒什麼 錢德在我這邊，他非常非常…

18
00:00:59,650 --> 00:01:01,680
The One with Chandler in a Box
本集播出：閉關思過

00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:05,680
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

19
00:01:46,130 --> 00:01:48,030
Oh,turkey!
火雞…

20
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:50,970
Giving thanks!
說謝謝

21
00:01:51,870 --> 00:01:54,740
Look,everyone. It's the spirit of Thanksgiving!
看，這就是感恩節的精神

22
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:57,200
Are things with Joey better?
你跟喬伊好一點了嗎？

23
00:01:57,450 --> 00:02:00,180
They couldn't be worse. I spent eight hours calling him...
糟到不能再糟 我昨晚打了8小時電話給他 

25
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:02,320
...trying to get him to talk to me.
想讓他跟我說上一句話

26
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:05,110
Eight hours.
8小時

27
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:09,080
You could probably use a plug-in telephone headset.
你應該用得上耳機吧？

28
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:13,660
Should we all expect Christmas gifts that are stolen from your office?
我們會收到 你從公司偷來的聖誕禮物嗎？

29
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:17,360
You shouldn't.
你不會

30
00:02:19,330 --> 00:02:20,530
Speaking of Christmas....
講到聖誕節

31
00:02:20,770 --> 00:02:24,670
Since Monica and I are starting a new business and have no money...
摩妮卡和我剛開業，沒有錢

32
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:29,540
...this year we could do Secret Santa and each only buy one gift.
今年就來抽籤互送吧 這樣只要買一份禮物 

34
00:02:29,810 --> 00:02:33,010
And there's the added mystery of who gets who.
還可以猜猜看誰抽到誰

35
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:36,280
Who gets whom.
誰抽到「哪個人」

36
00:02:38,490 --> 00:02:40,510
I don't know why I do that.
我是無意識的

37
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:44,990
But it is correct.
但那樣才合文法

38
00:02:45,130 --> 00:02:48,190
Hey,what's this? It's all of your names.
這是什麼？ 是你們的名字！

39
00:02:48,330 --> 00:02:50,460
Let's pick.
來抽吧

40
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:54,060
Hey,what's going?
你們在…

41
00:02:55,900 --> 00:03:00,030
-No,Joey,stay. -We're picking names for Secret Santa.
喬伊，不要走 我們要抽籤送禮

43
00:03:00,210 --> 00:03:02,180
Okay.
好啦

44
00:03:02,610 --> 00:03:05,440
I invented Secret Santa,you know.
這個做法是我發明的

45
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:10,780
What are you laughing at? You're the one who said Die Hard was your idea.
你笑什麼？ 你也說「終極警探」 是你的構想

47
00:03:10,950 --> 00:03:13,180
It was.
本來就是

48
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:17,360
Don't make me show you the napkin.
別逼我把紙巾拿出來

49
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:26,560
I'm going to take a nap. Turkey makes me sleepy.
我要去睡個覺，火雞讓我愛睏

50
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,630
We haven't eaten yet.
還沒吃耶

51
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:33,740
I know,but all that work you're doing to get it ready and....
我知道，但你那堆準備過程…

52
00:03:35,510 --> 00:03:39,310
Did you pick Rachel for your Secret Santa? I'll trade for her.
你們有人抽到瑞秋嗎？我要換

53
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:43,080
I picked her. Thank God,you want her!
我抽到她，幸好你要她

54
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:45,720
Why do you want to get rid of her so badly?
你為什麼這麼想換掉她？

55
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,850
She exchanges every gift she gets.
因為她收到什麼都拿去換 

56
00:03:48,090 --> 00:03:50,490
It's impossible to get her something she likes.
要讓她滿意根本不可能

57
00:03:50,690 --> 00:03:52,220
Come on,let's trade!
來換吧

58
00:03:52,490 --> 00:03:55,190
I got her that backpack and she loved it.
哪有這回事 她很喜歡我送她的背包

59
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:58,260
I remember she cried when that big dog ran off with
有只大狗把它叼走時 她哭得好…

60
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,230
There was no big dog.
沒有什麼大狗

61
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:09,270
This sucks! I already got her a briefcase with "R.G." put on it.
真是的，我已經買了個公事包 還拿去燙了RG

62
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:12,040
Her initials.
她的姓名縮寫

63
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:16,410
Okay,I'm really bad at initials.
我很不會認縮寫

64
00:04:17,150 --> 00:04:18,950
You got your shopping done early.
你今年禮物買得真早

65
00:04:19,090 --> 00:04:22,720
Yeah,well,my Camel Cash was about to expire.
我的禮券快過期了

66
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:26,180
Maybe you can give it to somebody else. Like Ross Geller!
也許你可以送給別人 像羅斯蓋勒（縮寫亦為RG）

68
00:04:27,030 --> 00:04:29,360
You know what? It's a girlie briefcase.
那是個女用公事包

69
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:33,100
Who cares! He works in a museum.
那又怎樣，他在博物館上班

70
00:04:34,470 --> 00:04:36,630
The big game's about to start!
現在幾點？球賽要開始了

71
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:40,000
Ross and Joey aren't here. You can watch the parade if you want.
羅斯喬伊不在，你可以看遊行

73
00:04:40,170 --> 00:04:41,900
Thanks.
謝了

74
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:45,070
What is wrong with this freezer?
這個冷凍庫怎麼搞的

75
00:04:46,750 --> 00:04:49,150
-What happened? -lce just got in my eye!
怎麼了？ 我的眼睛被冰扎到

76
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:52,810
People are trying to sleep in here!
這裡有人要睡覺

77
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:54,950
Monica got ice in her eye and it hurts!
摩妮卡的眼睛被冰扎到很痛

78
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:58,120
-Open it up. Let me see. -I can't. It really kills.
張開讓我看看 不行，真的很痛

79
00:04:58,390 --> 00:05:00,950
Maybe you should put some ice on it.
也許你應該冰敷

80
00:05:02,830 --> 00:05:05,490
-lt looks bad. -We should take you to a doctor.
好像很嚴重 去看醫生好了

81
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:07,560
No,my eye doctor is Richard!
不行，我的眼科醫生是理查

82
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:10,630
I can't go to him when I don't have a boyfriend.
我沒有男朋友不能去見他

83
00:05:11,170 --> 00:05:13,540
He's really picky about his patients.
他對病患還真挑剔

84
00:05:14,210 --> 00:05:16,700
You've got to go. What's his office number?
你非去不可 他的診所電話幾號？

85
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:19,580
Like I remember his office number!
我哪會記得

86
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:21,270
Speed dial seven.
速撥鍵七

87
00:05:23,990 --> 00:05:26,920
I'm calling on behalf of Monica Geller's eye.
喂，我代表摩妮卡蓋勒的眼睛

88
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:31,020
Is Richard Burke in today?
理查柏克今天在嗎？

89
00:05:31,690 --> 00:05:33,960
He's not in. Will she see the on-call doctor?
他不在，她願意看候診醫師嗎

90
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:37,460
-Yes. -She's very excited about that!
願意！ 願意！她非常興奮

91
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,030
Okay,we'll be right in.
好，我們馬上過去

92
00:05:40,170 --> 00:05:42,140
Okay,so who's gonna take her in?
誰要帶她去？

93
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:45,300
I'll go,you can watch your parade.
我來，你去看遊行

94
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:53,680
It's so cool. Till Monica gets back,I'm head chef.
酷斃了 摩妮卡回來之前，我是主廚

95
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:56,410
And I get to make all the decisions.
我可以做決定

96
00:05:57,390 --> 00:06:00,250
She told you to follow the recipe exactly.
她叫你完全照食譜來

97
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:02,220
Get out of my kitchen.
滾出我的廚房

98
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:06,890
I think I'm making some progress with Joey.
好，我跟喬伊有進展了

99
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:09,660
When I walked in, he went to his bedroom...
我進門時，他走進他的房間 

100
00:06:09,900 --> 00:06:12,870
...but he only slammed the door once.
但只摔了一次門

101
00:06:13,030 --> 00:06:15,800
Yeah,he gave me the finger while doing it.
不過摔的時候有比中指

102
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:21,300
I've got to call my mom and ask her a left-handed cooking question.
我得問我媽左手烹飪的問題

103
00:06:24,010 --> 00:06:26,240
I'm gonna be in there.
我要進房裡去 

104
00:06:26,550 --> 00:06:28,780
While I'm gone....
我不在的時候…

105
00:06:31,290 --> 00:06:34,020
Chandler,you're in charge.
錢德，你負責

106
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:40,450
I picked Monica for Secret Santa,but I'm getting her something for Hanukkah.
我抽到摩妮卡 但我已經替她買了光明節禮物 

107
00:06:40,730 --> 00:06:42,390
You want to switch?
你想換嗎？

108
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:45,200
I was trying to trade...
其實我想換成...

109
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:46,460
...for you.
...你

110
00:06:48,870 --> 00:06:51,740
Really? That's so nice. What are you getting me?
真的？真好，你要送我什麼？

111
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:56,740
I don't know,R.G. I was thinking something girlie for your office.
不曉得，RG 某種女性化的上班用品吧

112
00:06:57,710 --> 00:07:00,480
Maybe Phoebe will switch with me.
也許菲比會跟我換

113
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:05,050
Then you'll get stuck with Rachel, and she exchanges every gift.
最好不要，那你會抽到瑞秋 她什麼禮物都拿去換

114
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:08,120
No,I got her lots of stuff she never took back.
亂講 我送她很多東西她都沒退

115
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:09,380
Like?
比如？

116
00:07:09,590 --> 00:07:12,120
Like that gold necklace I got her last year.
像我去年送她的金項鏈

117
00:07:12,330 --> 00:07:13,730
When did she wear it last?
她上次戴是哪時？

118
00:07:14,230 --> 00:07:18,160
She wore it all Christmas day and then....
她聖誕節整天都戴著，然後…

119
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:20,430
Big dog?
大狗？

120
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:28,570
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

121
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:31,300
Sending back this stuff Chandler bought.
把錢德因內疚買的東西退回去

122
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:35,610
-Even the TV? -No,I'll put that in my room.
全部？包括電視？ 不，電視要搬進房裡

124
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:41,450
Listen,Joey. I know what he did was wrong.
喬伊，我知道他做錯了

125
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:43,420
But can't you hear him out?
但你就不能聽他解釋嗎？

126
00:07:44,030 --> 00:07:47,650
If Chandler had kissed Rachel, would you hear him out?
你和瑞秋在一起的時候， 如果錢德吻了瑞秋，你會聽他解釋麼

128
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,120
That's a good point.
說得好

129
00:07:51,170 --> 00:07:53,500
How long you going to punish him?
那你要罰他多久？ 

130
00:07:53,730 --> 00:07:55,290
Five years.
5年

131
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:57,490
You've sentenced him?
你還判了刑？ 

132
00:07:57,910 --> 00:08:00,740
Don't do the crime if you can't do the time.
不敢當就不要做

133
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,900
The guy's your best friend.
他是你最要好的朋友 

134
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:05,010
Was my best friend.
曾經是我最好的朋友

135
00:08:05,210 --> 00:08:07,180
I don't know why you're pushing for him.
你幹嘛拚命替他說情？

136
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:12,040
With him out of the way as my best friend,there's a spot open.
少了他礙事 我就沒有最要好的朋友了

137
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:15,950
-Who,me? -Yeah.
我嗎？ 對

138
00:08:16,990 --> 00:08:20,930
I'm honored. You know what I'm going to do as your best friend?
我真榮幸 你知道我首先要做什麼？

139
00:08:21,330 --> 00:08:23,700
I'm going to get you to talk to Chandler.
拉你去跟錢德說話

140
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:27,020
All right.
好啦

141
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,930
But if you weren't my best friend....
若非你是我最好的朋友…

142
00:08:32,170 --> 00:08:34,570
Oh,my God. Is it really that bad?
天哪，真的那麼嚴重？

143
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,040
I walk in the room, and he won't talk to me.
我進了門，他根本不理我

144
00:08:37,250 --> 00:08:40,210
He just mumbles something in ltalian.
只念了幾句意大利文

145
00:08:41,380 --> 00:08:44,110
And I know he only knows the bad words.
我知道他只會髒話

146
00:08:45,950 --> 00:08:49,580
I'm so,so sorry. I feel responsible.
真對不起，都是我不好

147
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,890
It's not your fault.
不是你的錯

148
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:59,360
-Gunther,have you seen Chandler? -I thought you were Chandler.
阿甘，你有看見錢德嗎？ 我以為你才是錢德

150
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:04,070
But one of you is over there.
你們其中一個在那邊

151
00:09:12,450 --> 00:09:14,740
Hey,Joe.
喬伊

152
00:09:15,154 --> 00:09:16,849
（意大利文）

153
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:26,760
I'll be right with you. Thanks for coming in.
我馬上就好 謝謝你

154
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:31,960
Oh,my God! How cute is the on-call doctor?
天哪，這個候診醫生真帥

155
00:09:32,470 --> 00:09:36,330
So cute that I'm thinking about jamming this pen in my eye.
帥到我想拿筆插我的眼睛

156
00:09:45,250 --> 00:09:49,980
-You have the best luck with eye doctors. -I know.
你的眼科醫生緣真好 我知道

157
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:53,020
Dr. Burke will see you now.
柏克醫生可以見你了

158
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:56,920
Not Dr. Burke. The on-call doctor will see me now.
不是柏克醫生，柏克醫生不在 是候診醫生要幫我看

159
00:09:57,330 --> 00:09:58,590
Dr. Richard Burke is out.
理查柏克醫生不在 

160
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:02,090
Dr. Timothy Burke,his son, will see you now.
他兒子提摩西柏克醫生幫你看

161
00:10:03,730 --> 00:10:05,430
Ready?
準備好了嗎？

162
00:10:12,310 --> 00:10:14,300
Hey,I'm sorry. That
對不起，剛才…

163
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:18,470
-Where you going? -My folks'.
你要去哪裡？ 我爸媽家

164
00:10:20,450 --> 00:10:21,970
When you coming back?
什麼時候回來？

165
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:26,650
I don't know. I might stay there while I look for an apartment.
不知道 可能會住幾天順便找房子

166
00:10:27,660 --> 00:10:28,640
What?
什麼？

167
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:33,520
I thought we could talk about this. Work it out.
原先我以為我們可以談開來

169
00:10:33,690 --> 00:10:35,720
Seeing you two together,I don't....
但是看到你們在一起…

170
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,230
What do you want me to say? Should I stop seeing her?
你要我說什麼？ 說我不見她嗎？

171
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:41,960
It's not about her. Okay?
跟她無關，好嗎？

172
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:45,670
But seeing you together reminds me of what you did.
但看到你們在一起 就讓我想起你做的事

173
00:10:45,970 --> 00:10:50,470
I won't live with someone who doesn't know what it is to be a friend.
我不跟一個不懂朋友道義的人 住在一起

174
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:54,810
I know what it is to be a friend. I screwed up.
我懂朋友道義，只是我搞砸了

176
00:10:55,050 --> 00:10:56,540
Yeah,you did.
對，沒錯

177
00:10:57,550 --> 00:10:59,540
And that's why I'm leaving.
所以我要離開

178
00:11:00,490 --> 00:11:04,980
If you're not going to stay for me, then at least stay for them.
你不為我留下來 至少為它們留下來

179
00:11:06,190 --> 00:11:09,890
They had a very difficult year. What with the robbery and all.
它們這1年很不順，還被搶

180
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:13,330
And that chick used to be very cute.
小雞本來很可愛的

181
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:15,060
When that guy was robbing us...
當那個人搶了我們 

182
00:11:15,270 --> 00:11:18,100
...and I was locked in the entertainment unit for six hours...
我在櫃子裡關了6小時

183
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,900
...do you know what I was doing?
你知道我在做什麼？ 

184
00:11:20,170 --> 00:11:22,670
I was thinking about how I let you down.
我在想我太讓你失望了

185
00:11:24,610 --> 00:11:29,170
If I knew what kind of friend you'd be,I wouldn't have worried.
對，早知道你會見色忘友 我根本不會擔心

187
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:34,450
Wait one second! There has to be something that I can do.
等一下…一定有什麼我能做的

188
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:36,050
If we still had that unit...
如果櫃子還在

189
00:11:36,260 --> 00:11:40,990
...I'd get in it for six hours and think about how I let you down.
我會關6小時 檢討我有多讓你失望

190
00:11:45,700 --> 00:11:46,690
What?

191
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,600
We got a box.
我們有一個箱子

192
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:54,970
I remember the last time I saw you.
我記得上次見到你 

193
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,510
It was the morning I left for college.
是去外地唸書的早上

194
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:00,810
You were standing outside the Dairy Queen.
你站在乳品店外面

195
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:04,710
Just probably waiting for it to open.
八成是在等它開店

196
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:09,180
-You look great now. -You look great too.
你現在好漂亮 你也很帥

197
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,650
You're an excellent patient.
你真是個好病人

198
00:12:12,730 --> 00:12:13,720
How does it look?
情況如何？

199
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:18,060
You have a scratch on your cornea. You have to wear a patch.
你的角膜有刮傷 得戴幾天眼罩

200
00:12:18,370 --> 00:12:20,060
Like a pirate?
像海盜那樣？

201
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,530
If that helps you.
你懂就好

202
00:12:26,870 --> 00:12:29,840
How long have you been working with your dad?
你跟著你爸多久了？

203
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:33,140
Come on,one of us had to mention him.
總得有人提到他

204
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:36,470
I moved back here a couple months ago.
我是2個月前搬回來的

205
00:12:37,550 --> 00:12:39,990
Big family dinner tonight?
晚上要家庭聚餐？

206
00:12:41,090 --> 00:12:42,720
No way!
不會吧

207
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:45,550
I was gonna have Thanksgiving at my girlfriend's.
我本來要去女朋友家吃飯

208
00:12:45,830 --> 00:12:47,380
But we broke up.
但我們分手了

209
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:52,590
She wasn't ready for a serious commitment.
她還不想定下來

210
00:12:55,170 --> 00:12:58,140
So you made her walk the plank, aye,matey?
所以你讓她跳海吃自己？

211
00:12:59,310 --> 00:13:00,830
You're not wearing the patch yet.
你還沒戴眼罩呢

212
00:13:04,310 --> 00:13:05,940
I know.
我知道

213
00:13:11,650 --> 00:13:14,640
-He's coming here for Thanksgiving? -I know. It's sick.
他要來過感恩節？ 對啊，好變態喔

215
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:17,680
-Why is it sick? -It's Richard's son!
為什麼變態？ 因為他是理查的兒子

216
00:13:17,890 --> 00:13:21,790
It's like inviting a Greek tragedy over for dinner.
這跟找希臘悲劇來吃飯一樣

217
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:25,490
If it were Greek, I'd be blind in both eyes.
希臘人會把兩隻眼睛都蒙住

218
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:30,940
I like him because he's handsome and he's nice and smart and handsome.
我喜歡他的英俊、體帖 聰明和…英俊

219
00:13:32,570 --> 00:13:35,040
Phoebe,you understand,don't you?
菲比，你瞭解吧？

220
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:38,410
I could see where I'd be your best shot,but no.
我知道你為什麼指望我 但是不行

221
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:42,140
Sorry,honey. I think it's twisted.
對不起，我覺得很畸形

222
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:45,150
-What's twisted? -Me going out with Richard's son.
什麼事畸形？ 我跟理查的兒子交往

223
00:13:45,558 --> 00:13:46,991
好惡！

224
00:13:48,327 --> 00:13:49,419
惡惡惡

225
00:13:51,090 --> 00:13:53,150
It sounds like a really bad idea to me.
我覺得實在不太好

226
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:59,830
-ls he okay in there? -He's fine!
他這樣可以嗎？ 他好得很

227
00:14:00,430 --> 00:14:03,230
If things work out between you and Richard's son...
要是你跟理查的兒子有結果 

228
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,060
...you can tell your kids...
你就可以告訴孩子

229
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:07,760
...that you slept with their grandfather.
你跟他們的爺爺上過床

230
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,010
Judge all you want to.
隨你們怎麼批評

231
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:13,580
Married a lesbian, left a man at the altar...
娶到女同志，臨陣逃婚 

232
00:14:13,850 --> 00:14:15,320
...Ioved a gay ice dancer...
愛上同性戀冰上舞者

233
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:18,580
...threw a girl's wooden leg in the fire,live in a box!
把女生的木腿丟進火裡 睡在箱子裡

234
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:28,620
What exactly is the point of the box?
睡箱子的用意到底何在？ 錢德

235
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:33,990
The meaning of the box is threefold.
有三重意義

236
00:14:34,570 --> 00:14:38,630
One,it gives me the time to think about what I did.
第一，讓我有時間反省

237
00:14:39,010 --> 00:14:43,770
Two,it proves how much I care about my friendship with Joey.
第二，證明我有多重視 跟喬伊的友誼

238
00:14:44,450 --> 00:14:45,940
And three...
第三…

239
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,280
...it hurts.
會痛

240
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:52,880
And if he stays in the box you guys will be friends again?
他關在裡面，你們就能和好？

241
00:14:53,250 --> 00:14:55,850
Let's just say it's a start.
這是個開始

242
00:14:56,320 --> 00:15:00,490
Remember that necklace I gave you last year?
記得我去年送你的項鏈嗎？ 

244
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:02,320
Can I see it?
可以給我看嗎？

245
00:15:03,100 --> 00:15:04,390
Why?
為什麼？ 

246
00:15:04,730 --> 00:15:06,930
I just want to check something.
我只是想看一下

247
00:15:07,370 --> 00:15:08,840
Okay.
好

248
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:13,570
Now we'll see.
等著瞧吧

249
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:16,300
Air hole! Air hole!
沒氣了！沒氣了

250
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:21,310
Here it is. I love it. I wear it all the time.
在這裡，我很喜歡，我常戴

251
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:27,850
The necklace I got you was gold. This is silver.
我送的是金項鏈，這是銀的

252
00:15:30,090 --> 00:15:32,520
Well,maybe...
也許它…

253
00:15:33,530 --> 00:15:34,930
...it changed.
變色了

254
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:38,590
Oh,my God! You actually exchanged it.
天哪，你真的拿去換

255
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:42,000
Isn't it better to exchange it for something I enjoy...
換一個我喜歡又常用的東西 

256
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,530
...and can use a lot?
不是比較好？

257
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,500
What did you get?
你換了什麼？ 

258
00:15:45,710 --> 00:15:47,330
Credit.
換購金額

259
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:53,410
I'll get it. I'll get it. I'll get it. I'll get it. I'll get it.
我來開我來開…

260
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,380
Hi,Tim.
提姆

261
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:02,080
Thank you. Come meet my friends.
謝謝，來見我的朋友

262
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:04,980
Phoebe.
這是菲比 幸會

263
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:06,490
And Joey.
喬伊 你好

264
00:16:06,730 --> 00:16:08,320
My brother,Ross.
我哥哥羅斯 你好

265
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,150
And Rachel.
還有瑞秋

266
00:16:13,130 --> 00:16:14,600
That's Chandler.
那是錢德 

267
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:16,300
How do you do?
你好

268
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,500
-What's? -Well,he's....
這是… 他在…

269
00:16:20,740 --> 00:16:22,970
He's doing some thinking.
他在反省

270
00:16:28,450 --> 00:16:31,480
-What happened? -You kissed my girlfriend!
怎麼了？ 你親了我的女朋友

271
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,420
I like those sunglasses.
我喜歡那個墨鏡

272
00:16:37,990 --> 00:16:43,120
"Like them" like them? Or "I'd like to get store credit" like them?
是喜歡的喜歡 還是可以換成換購金額的喜歡

273
00:16:44,603 --> 00:16:46,195
（意大利文）

274
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:51,930
This turkey is ready.
各位，火雞上桌了

275
00:16:52,370 --> 00:16:54,100
Where can I wash up?
哪裡可以洗手？ 

276
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:56,140
Let me show you.
來…我帶你去

277
00:16:56,610 --> 00:16:58,370
The towels are hanging next to the sink.
毛巾掛在洗手台旁邊

278
00:16:58,750 --> 00:17:01,610
-And you can use the fancy soap. -Thank you.
你可以用高級香皂 謝謝

279
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:06,450
Fancy soap? I thought we were saving that for the pope.
高級香皂？ 我以為要留給教宗用

280
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:09,550
See. He's nice,right?
他人很好吧？

281
00:17:09,790 --> 00:17:12,920
Do you want a relationship where you can actually say:
但你真的想在談戀愛時說

282
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,820
"That's not how your dad used to do it"?
「你爸的做法不同」？

283
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:23,130
Everything looks great. Where should I sit?
看起來好好吃，我坐哪裡？ 

284
00:17:23,340 --> 00:17:24,330
Saved you a seat.
我幫你留了

285
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,300
Sick,sick,sick,sick.
變態變態變態變態

286
00:17:29,610 --> 00:17:31,100
I'll get it.
我去開

287
00:17:31,450 --> 00:17:33,110
Got you!
被我騙了

288
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:38,110
That doesn't sound like thinking to me.
這聽起來不像是反省

289
00:17:38,990 --> 00:17:41,920
-Sorry! -You shouldn't be talking at all.
對不起 你不應該說話

290
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:45,290
You've got too much thinking to do to be talking and joking.
你要想的太多了 不該說話開玩笑

291
00:17:45,630 --> 00:17:47,290
Okay,you got it!
好，沒問題

292
00:17:47,490 --> 00:17:49,260
Ross,pass me the yams?
羅斯，把蕃薯給我

293
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:54,090
Joey's got the mashed potatoes if you want to exchange them.
好，你想換的話 喬伊那裡有馬鈴薯泥

294
00:17:57,940 --> 00:18:00,170
Will you stop! What's the matter with you?
夠了，你是怎麼搞的？

295
00:18:00,810 --> 00:18:03,040
We've got company.
有客人喔

296
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:06,280
Nothing's the matter with me.
我沒怎麼搞的

297
00:18:06,450 --> 00:18:10,440
I'm not completely devoid of sentiment. I have feelings.
我不是麻木不仁的人 我也有感覺

298
00:18:11,250 --> 00:18:13,480
Okay,fine.
好，很好

299
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:23,260
You can't tell,but I'm breaking the tension by mooning you guys.
你們看不到 但我正在露屁股打圓場

300
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:30,800
All right,look!
聽著

301
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:33,970
If this is a big joke to you, forget about it.
如果你把它當成笑話 那就算了

302
00:18:34,210 --> 00:18:36,200
This means something to me.
這對我很重要

303
00:18:36,410 --> 00:18:39,350
If it doesn't mean anything to you, then get out of there.
要是對你不重要，你就死出來 

304
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:41,780
Otherwise,you're just an idiot in a box.
否則就太白癡了

305
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:45,580
You're right. I'm sorry. This means a lot to me.
你說得對，對不起 這對我非常重要 

307
00:18:45,790 --> 00:18:50,120
I want to be friends again. I swear I won't say another word.
我想跟你和解 我發誓不會再說話了

308
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:53,650
-So you'll take this seriously? -Absolutely!
你會當一回事？ 絕對會

309
00:18:53,990 --> 00:18:56,220
That sounds like another word to me.
你又說話羅

310
00:18:57,230 --> 00:18:59,500
Are you going to take this seriously?
你會當一回事嗎？

311
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:04,940
Okay!
很好

312
00:19:07,010 --> 00:19:09,910
Don't say that I have no sentiment.
別說我麻木不仁

313
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:13,810
This is a movie stub from our first date.
這是第一次約會的電影票根

314
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:17,980
This eggshell is from the first time you made me breakfast in bed.
這是你第一次 為我做床上早餐的蛋殼

315
00:19:18,590 --> 00:19:22,720
This is from the museum, the first time we...
這是博物館的，我們第一次…

316
00:19:22,990 --> 00:19:24,420
...were together.
在一起

317
00:19:25,330 --> 00:19:30,230
Maybe I exchange gifts sometimes, but I keep the things that matter.
我有時會換禮物 但重要的東西我會留

318
00:19:31,530 --> 00:19:33,830
I don't know what to say. I'm sorry.
我不知道該說什麼，對不起

319
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:38,900
Though you're not supposed to take these.
但是…這個不能拿

320
00:19:42,510 --> 00:19:44,440
It's,like,a million years old.
它有百萬年的歷史

321
00:19:45,450 --> 00:19:49,780
We actually have people looking for that.
我們還得派專人去挖

322
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:59,020
-Mind if I smoke? -Care if I die?
我可以抽煙嗎？ 想害死我嗎？

323
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:02,930
No,I'm just kidding,I'm just kidding. Go ahead,smoke.
開玩笑的，你抽吧

324
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:04,620
This always happens.
老是會卡住 

325
00:20:05,230 --> 00:20:06,670
Here,let me.
讓我來

326
00:20:07,230 --> 00:20:08,720
Thank you.
謝謝

327
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:14,240
You have very beautiful...
你有很漂亮的...

328
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,670
...eye.
..眼睛

329
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:20,270
My friends think this is weird.
我朋友都覺得這樣很怪 

330
00:20:20,950 --> 00:20:23,310
Even the one in the box?
包括箱子裡那個？

331
00:20:24,180 --> 00:20:25,340
It's not weird,is it?
這樣不會很怪吧？

332
00:20:26,050 --> 00:20:30,050
I thought it would be. I almost canceled,but it really isn't.
我原先也覺得會，還差點取消 但其實不會

333
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:33,960
I know. Me and your dad, that's totally separate.
我知道 我跟你爸完全是兩回事

334
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:36,160
I totally agree.
我完全同意

335
00:20:36,930 --> 00:20:39,460
We're two people who find each other...
我們只是兩個… 

336
00:20:39,830 --> 00:20:41,800
...very attractive.
...互相吸引的人

337
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,490
Right?
對吧？

338
00:20:54,410 --> 00:20:57,470
-What? -Nothing,nothing.
怎麼了？ 沒事

339
00:20:57,820 --> 00:21:00,510
No,really. Was that not okay?
那個吻不好嗎？ 

340
00:21:00,750 --> 00:21:02,020
No,that was good.
不，很好

341
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:04,750
That was a good kiss.
那個吻很好

342
00:21:05,990 --> 00:21:09,160
-lt reminded you of -Don't say it!
天哪！它讓你想到… 別說

343
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:11,990
-lt did,didn't it? -Yes!
但是有，對吧？ 對！

344
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:14,530
I know!
天哪！ 我知道

345
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:20,970
God,I am sorry. I am so sorry.
對不起，我真的很抱歉

346
00:21:21,110 --> 00:21:26,140
It's okay. It wouldn't be Thanksgiving without a little emotional scarring.
沒關係 少了感情瘡疤就不叫感恩節

347
00:21:27,010 --> 00:21:29,070
You know what's even worse?
更糟的是...

348
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:30,740
My friends were right.
我朋友說得對

349
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:36,850
You know what's worst for me is you remind me of a younger version of my mom.
最糟的是 我覺得你就像年輕的我媽

350
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:02,810
-I want you to know how sorry I am -It's okay.
聽著，我真的很抱歉… 沒關係

351
00:22:03,020 --> 00:22:07,540
-Chandler's the one I'm mad at. -Well,I'm still sorry.
我氣的是錢德 我還是很抱歉

353
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:11,390
-ls he here? -ln the box.
他在嗎？ 在箱子裡

354
00:22:20,570 --> 00:22:23,060
He can't talk right now.
錢德？ 他現在不能說話

355
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:25,430
Why not? What's going on?
為什麼？怎麼了？

356
00:22:25,810 --> 00:22:28,570
He's trying to show Joey how much he means to him.
他想表示他很重視喬伊

357
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:32,840
-By being in a box? -Joey had reasons.
所以窩在箱子裡？ 喬伊有他的理由

358
00:22:34,510 --> 00:22:35,810
They were threefold.
有三重意義

359
00:22:41,190 --> 00:22:45,680
You not being able to talk might make this easier.
你不能說話反而讓事情好辦

360
00:22:45,930 --> 00:22:47,830
Listen....
聽我說…

361
00:22:57,900 --> 00:23:02,840
I don't want to be someone who comes between two best friends.
聽我說 我不想介入兩個最要好的朋友

362
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:07,840
I can't stand seeing what this is doing to you guys.
我不忍心看著這件事影響你們 

363
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:11,050
And I don't want to be the cause of that.
我不想成為罪魁禍首

365
00:23:12,250 --> 00:23:14,550
I don't think we can see each other anymore.
所以我們不該再見面了

366
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:18,120
I'm going to my mom's in Chicago.
我要去芝加哥找我媽 

367
00:23:18,530 --> 00:23:20,960
I'm going to stay there for a while.
我會住一陣子

368
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:29,760
I think this could have been something really amazing.
這段感情本來會很美好

369
00:23:29,970 --> 00:23:34,100
But,you know,this is probably for the best.
但這麼做最好

370
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,600
You know?
你懂嗎？

371
00:23:41,450 --> 00:23:43,210
I'm going to miss you.
我會想你的

372
00:23:46,320 --> 00:23:48,310
Goodbye,Chandler.
別了，錢德

373
00:23:57,900 --> 00:23:59,960
Open the box!
把箱子打開啦

374
00:24:00,830 --> 00:24:01,820
What?
什麼？ 

375
00:24:01,970 --> 00:24:06,460
He can still catch her. Get out of there! Get out of there!
他還追得上她，快出來啦

376
00:24:08,710 --> 00:24:12,080
We're going to be fine. Get out!
所以… 我們沒事啦，出來啦

377
00:24:13,950 --> 00:24:16,380
You did some real good thinking in there.
真的？ 對，你好好反省過了

378
00:24:17,550 --> 00:24:19,820
I mean,this is....
這真是…

379
00:24:23,560 --> 00:24:25,250
You could still catch her!
快，你還追得上她

380
00:24:25,690 --> 00:24:28,350
And merry Christmas from your Secret Santa!
神秘聖誕老人祝你聖誕快樂

381
00:24:32,130 --> 00:24:35,730
All right,who got Chandler? Because I need to trade.
誰抽到錢德？我要換

382
00:24:41,410 --> 00:24:43,470
He sees her!
他看到她了

383
00:24:43,710 --> 00:24:46,240
He's catching up to her.
他在追她

384
00:24:47,310 --> 00:24:48,870
She sees him!
她看到他了

385
00:24:49,580 --> 00:24:51,180
They're hugging!
他們擁抱了

386
00:24:53,220 --> 00:24:55,380
He's taking her purse.
他在搶她的皮包

387
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:58,320
That's not them.
那不是他們

388
00:24:58,530 --> 00:25:00,360
I'll go call the police.
我去報警

389
00:25:03,100 --> 00:25:05,000
There they are!
他們在那裡

390
00:25:11,710 --> 00:25:13,730
All right,get a room.
快去開房間吧

391
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


392
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
